Log source:        connector
Display name:      Connector logs
Resource:          connector (crn: organization/environment/cloud-cluster/connector)
Scopes:            resource
Max lookback:      3d
Full-text search:  yes (--search-text over: message, exception.stacktrace)

Search fields (--search field=value):
  level    enum    INFO, WARN, ERROR, FATAL
  task_id  string
  id       string

Returned fields (each log record):
  timestamp             timestamp  *
  level                 enum       *
  task_id               string     *
  message               string     *
  exception.stacktrace  string     *
  id                    string     *
  name                  string     *

  * = default column in human output
